# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Credentials. `.env.local` is already covered by *.local above, but a plain
# `.env` is not — and that is the file people create by mistake. Never commit
# Supabase keys or admin logins; they belong in .env.local locally and in
# GitHub Actions secrets for CI.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

